Translated: MixGlyphDescriptor feature order, AbstractExtractor centroid and
radius, BasicARTExtractor/BasicLUT angular-radial moments, GeometricMoments,
and the no-ROI pixel enumeration in RunTable.cumulate. Added explicit input
validation, Rust OnceLock LUT reuse, and binary/run adapters. No page processing.

oracle/Bravura.otf is unmodified Audiveris 5.11.0 bundled Bravura 1.392.
Its embedded copyright is © 2021 Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH,
with Reserved Font Name "Bravura", under SIL Open Font License 1.1.
The embedded complete notice/license is reproduced in oracle/OFL-Bravura.txt.
Three glyph bitmaps are rendered locally from that font for tests. Other
bitmaps are synthetic. No scanned score or uncertain training image is used.

The Java oracle uses unchanged numerical/Glyph/RunTable classes. Two test-only
configuration stubs disable registration and the ART printWatch timing flag;
they do not replace numerical operations. See README for the exact scope.

Production crate dependencies: Rust standard library only. Classifier and JSON
libraries are development-only dependencies used to verify the end-to-end
feature->score chain. Their notices remain with the sibling classifier crate.
